5,1,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I'm so ready to help fix the trash spot! Let's make it super clean and awesome so nobody complains anymore! What should we check first to make it the best ever?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"It is lovely to see your energy, Rin! I agree, we should find a solution that makes everyone happy. I think it would be wise to start by understanding the current situation and the costs involved.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's keep our expectations realistic. Before we start dreaming of ""awesome"" spots, we need to see what the ward actually allows and what we've spent in the past. Logic should lead this, not just enthusiasm.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm with Shunichi on the logic, but let's not make it too boring! I want to make sure we don't just pick a plan that looks good on paper but turns into a nightmare for us later.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that we need a logical approach. However, we must ensure that the burden of maintenance is distributed fairly. Let's examine the data to see who has been bearing the most responsibility until now.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I want to know what it's actually like for people! I'll check ""Supervised mornings on the next lane"" and ""Visit to the station block's bin house"" to see how other places do it!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I think it's important to be mindful of our finances. I'll look into the ""Block ledger of refuse-point expenses"" and ""Ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs"" to see what we've been spending.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll handle the bureaucracy. I'll check the ""Ward filing requirements per the installations clerk"" and ""Statements at the residents' meeting."" It's better to know the rules and the grievances before we start guessing.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I'll take a look at the ""Truck arrival time from the crew leader"" and ""The station block's meeting minutes."" I want to see how much time this actually eats up and if others have struggled with the workload!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I will examine the ""Measurements of the five frontages"" and the ""Ward complaint log for this point."" I want to understand the physical constraints and the specific nature of the complaints to ensure a truly equitable arrangement.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"That sounds like a great plan! Everyone is looking into different things, just like a team of detectives! I can't wait to see if the other bin houses are cool or if they're just boring!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,It really does feel like a team effort! I hope the financial records give us a clear picture so we can find a balance that feels fair and comfortable for every household.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"A ""team of detectives"" is a bit much, Rin, but I suppose it's better than us arguing in circles. Let's just hope the data is actually useful so we can wrap this up efficiently.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm sure it'll be useful! I've got a feeling the meeting minutes will reveal some juicy details about how the other blocks handle the stress. Let's see who finds the most interesting clues!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I am less interested in ""clues"" and more interested in facts. Let us proceed with the research and reconvene once we have the data. I expect a transparent discussion regarding the actual impact on each household.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm on it! I'll go explore and find out all the secrets of the other trash spots! See you all soon, bye-bye!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I will do my best to find the information we need. I hope we can find a way to make this work for everyone's budget. See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll be seeing what the ward actually expects from us. Let's hope the residents' statements aren't just a list of petty grievances. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,May,,I'm off to do some digging! I'll find out if this is going to be a total time-sink or something we can actually handle. See you all in a bit!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will begin my research now. I intend to verify the physical layout and the history of complaints to ensure that no single household is unfairly burdened by the new arrangement. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
